  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-006c006c006c'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 9), 'Theft', 'Poblacion, Sample street 1, Argao, Cebu', 9.876321::float8, 123.603517::float8, '[SIMULATED #109] Poblacion, malapit sa daan papunta sa mga bahay, kahapon ng hapon. Pagbalik ko mula sa tindahan, wala na ang bag sa upuan. Hindi ko nakita kung may kumuha o may naglipat lang. Nandoon ang gamit ko sa trabaho kaya nag-aalala ako. Update: nakita ng staff ang bag sa ibang upuan. Natapos na ang paghahanap.', 'Resolved', 7, 228),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-006d006d006d'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 10), 'Suspicious Person', 'Langtad, Sample street 2, Argao, Cebu', 9.888126::float8, 123.606583::float8, '[SIMULATED #110] Langtad, near the path leading to the houses, last night. An unfamiliar visitor asked who was home, made no threats and left. It may have been a delivery, though we were not expecting one. This is an observation, not an accusation. This is not a real incident.', 'Archived', 14, 229),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-006e006e006e'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 11), 'Vehicular Accident', 'Canbanua, Sample street 3, Argao, Cebu', 9.885929::float8, 123.586229::float8, '[SIMULATED #111] Canbanua, duol sa agianan padulong sa mga balay, kagabii. Nakita nako ang duha ka motor nga nagbangga. Ang usa ka rider naglingkod sa kilid ug nagreklamo sa tiil. Wala ko kahibalo sa hinungdan, ug dili ko makasulti unsa kabug-at ang iyang samad. Dili ni tinuod nga hitabo.', 'Pending Review', 32, 230),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-006f006f006f'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 12), 'Online Scam / Suspicious Message', 'Casay, Sample street 4, Argao, Cebu', 9.839715::float8, 123.557829::float8, '[SIMULATED #112] Casay, near a small shop, last night. I received a text claiming my account would be locked unless I followed a link. I did not open it or send money. Sharing this as a reminder to check through official channels. This is not a real incident.', 'Under Verification', 39, 231),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-007000700070'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 13), 'Fire Incident', 'Colawin, Sample street 5, Argao, Cebu', 9.965148::float8, 123.548849::float8, '[SIMULATED #113] Colawin, near a small shop, last night. I saw dark smoke and flames from a small structure and moved away. I cannot confirm whether anyone was inside or what started the fire. This is not a real incident.', 'Under Verification', 46, 232),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-007100710071'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 14), 'General Safety Concern', 'Sumaguan, Sample street 6, Argao, Cebu', 9.962080::float8, 123.596034::float8, '[SIMULATED #114] Sumaguan, duol sa gamay nga tindahan, kagabii. Naay liki nga tabon sa kanal nga matamakan sa naglakaw. Nakita nako nga molihok kon maagian. Wala koy nakita nga nasamdan, pero basin ma-check sa maintenance sa dili pa naay matumba. Update: nailisan na ang tabon. Luwas na ang agianan sa akong pag-check.', 'Resolved', 53, 233),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-007200720072'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 15), 'Streetlight Outage', 'Mompeller, Sample street 7, Argao, Cebu', 9.978921::float8, 123.526870::float8, '[SIMULATED #115] Mompeller, near a small shop, last night. The light near the footpath has been out for two evenings. It is dark walking home from work. Could it be checked, especially as students use this path? Update: the light was working when I passed last night. Thanks to everyone who followed up.', 'Resolved', 60, 234),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-007300730073'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 16), 'Public Disturbance', 'Linut-od, Sample street 8, Argao, Cebu', 9.882641::float8, 123.478362::float8, '[SIMULATED #116] Linut-od, duol sa gamay nga tindahan, kagabii. Naay kusog nga panaglalis sa gawas. Nadungog sa among balay pero wala ko kakita og sinumbagay. Nabalaka ang mga bata, basin pwede ma-check sa tanod. Review update: wala kini makumpirma. Ayaw kini ipaambit isip tinuod nga hitabo.', 'Rejected', 78, 235),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-007400740074'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 17), 'Suspicious Vehicle', 'Talaytay, Sample street 9, Argao, Cebu', 9.894372::float8, 123.596405::float8, '[SIMULATED #117] Talaytay, duol sa gamay nga tindahan, kagabii. Naay van nga dugay nakaparada sa daplin. Wala koy nakita nga illegal nga gibuhat. Nangutana lang ko kon naay delivery diri aron dili ta magpataka og hunahuna. Review update: wala kini makumpirma. Ayaw kini ipaambit isip tinuod nga hitabo.', 'Marked Fake', 85, 236),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-007500750075'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 18), 'Reckless Driving', 'Talo-ot, Sample street 10, Argao, Cebu', 9.953423::float8, 123.612153::float8, '[SIMULATED #118] Talo-ot, malapit sa maliit na tindahan, kagabi. May motor na mabilis dumaan malapit sa mga naglalakad. Napapreno ang tricycle. Hindi ko nabasa ang plaka at ayokong manghula kung sino ang rider. Hindi ito totoong pangyayari.', 'Under Verification', 92, 237),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-007600760076'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 19), 'Lost Item', 'Gutlang, Sample street 11, Argao, Cebu', 9.976688::float8, 123.562828::float8, '[SIMULATED #119] Gutlang, sa may waiting shed, kagabii. Wala na akong pitaka pag-abot sa balay. Basin natagak sa akong gilakwan, wala ko kakita nga naay mikuha. Kon naay nakakita, i-turn over lang sa barangay ug ako mismo mo-describe sa sulod. Dili ni tinuod nga hitabo.', 'Pending Review', 99, 238),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-007700770077'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 20), 'Flooding', 'Jampang, Sample street 12, Argao, Cebu', 9.903223::float8, 123.575248::float8, '[SIMULATED #120] Jampang, sa may waiting shed, kagabi. Tumaas ang tubig matapos ang ulan at natakpan ang gilid ng daan. Hindi ako tumawid dahil hindi kita ang kanal. Nahihirapan nang dumaan ang maliliit na motor. Update: humupa na ang tubig pero maputik pa ang gilid. Mag-ingat pa rin.', 'Resolved', 106, 239),
