  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00e500e500e5'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 10), 'Suspicious Person', 'Langtad, Sample street 2, Argao, Cebu', 9.888126::float8, 123.606583::float8, '[SIMULATED #230] Langtad, near a small shop, earlier this morning. An unfamiliar visitor asked who was home, made no threats and left. It may have been a delivery, though we were not expecting one. This is an observation, not an accusation. Update: it was a delivery to the wrong house. This was clarified and no crime occurred.', 'Resolved', 138, 349),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00e600e600e6'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 11), 'Vehicular Accident', 'Canbanua, Sample street 3, Argao, Cebu', 9.885929::float8, 123.586229::float8, '[SIMULATED #231] Canbanua, by the waiting shed, yesterday afternoon. I saw two motorcycles collide. One rider was sitting at the side complaining of foot pain. I do not know the cause and cannot assess the injury. This is not a real incident.', 'Archived', 16, 350),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00e700e700e7'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 12), 'Online Scam / Suspicious Message', 'Casay, Sample street 4, Argao, Cebu', 9.839715::float8, 123.557829::float8, '[SIMULATED #232] Casay, sa may waiting shed, kagahapong hapon. Nakadawat kog text nga kuno ma-lock akong account ug kinahanglan pindoton ang link. Wala nako giablihan. Wala koy na-transfer nga kwarta. Basin makatabang nga pahimangno sa uban. Dili ni tinuod nga hitabo.', 'Pending Review', 23, 351),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00e800e800e8'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 13), 'Fire Incident', 'Colawin, Sample street 5, Argao, Cebu', 9.965148::float8, 123.548849::float8, '[SIMULATED #233] Colawin, by the waiting shed, yesterday afternoon. I saw dark smoke and flames from a small structure and moved away. I cannot confirm whether anyone was inside or what started the fire. This is not a real incident.', 'Under Verification', 30, 352),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00e900e900e9'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 14), 'General Safety Concern', 'Sumaguan, Sample street 6, Argao, Cebu', 9.962080::float8, 123.596034::float8, '[SIMULATED #234] Sumaguan, sa may waiting shed, kagahapong hapon. Naay liki nga tabon sa kanal nga matamakan sa naglakaw. Nakita nako nga molihok kon maagian. Wala koy nakita nga nasamdan, pero basin ma-check sa maintenance sa dili pa naay matumba. Dili ni tinuod nga hitabo.', 'Under Verification', 37, 353),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00ea00ea00ea'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 15), 'Streetlight Outage', 'Mompeller, Sample street 7, Argao, Cebu', 9.978921::float8, 123.526870::float8, '[SIMULATED #235] Mompeller, sa may waiting shed, kagahapong hapon. Duha na ka gabii nga dili mosiga ang poste duol sa agianan. Ngitngit inig-uli gikan trabaho. Basin mapatan-aw, ilabi na kay naay mga estudyante nga moagi. Update: misiga na paglabay nako kagabii. Salamat sa nitabang og follow-up.', 'Resolved', 44, 354),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00eb00eb00eb'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 16), 'Public Disturbance', 'Linut-od, Sample street 8, Argao, Cebu', 9.882641::float8, 123.478362::float8, '[SIMULATED #236] Linut-od, sa may waiting shed, kahapon ng hapon. May malakas na pagtatalo sa labas, rinig hanggang bahay. Wala akong nakitang suntukan. Natatakot ang mga bata, baka puwedeng matingnan ng tanod. Update: natigil ang pagtatalo at umalis na sila. Tahimik na ulit.', 'Resolved', 62, 355),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00ec00ec00ec'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 17), 'Suspicious Vehicle', 'Talaytay, Sample street 9, Argao, Cebu', 9.894372::float8, 123.596405::float8, '[SIMULATED #237] Talaytay, sa may waiting shed, kagahapong hapon. Naay van nga dugay nakaparada sa daplin. Wala koy nakita nga illegal nga gibuhat. Nangutana lang ko kon naay delivery diri aron dili ta magpataka og hunahuna. Review update: wala kini makumpirma. Ayaw kini ipaambit isip tinuod nga hitabo.', 'Rejected', 69, 356),
  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00ed00ed00ed'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 18), 'Reckless Driving', 'Talo-ot, Sample street 10, Argao, Cebu', 9.953423::float8, 123.612153::float8, '[SIMULATED #238] Talo-ot, sa gilid ng kurbada, kahapon ng hapon. May motor na mabilis dumaan malapit sa mga naglalakad. Napapreno ang tricycle. Hindi ko nabasa ang plaka at ayokong manghula kung sino ang rider. Review update: hindi ito nakumpirma. Huwag ibahagi bilang totoong pangyayari.', 'Marked Fake', 76, 357),
