  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-011901190119'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 2), 'General Safety Concern', 'Sumaguan, Sample street 6, Argao, Cebu', 9.962080::float8, 123.596034::float8, '[SIMULATED #282] Sumaguan, near a small shop, yesterday afternoon. A cracked drain cover on the footpath shifts when stepped on. I have not seen an injury, but it would help to have maintenance check it before someone trips. Review update: this was not confirmed. Do not share it as a real event.', 'Marked Fake', 63, 401),
