  ('a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-018401840184'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('poster', 9), 'Fire Incident', 'Colawin, Sample street 5, Argao, Cebu', 9.965148::float8, 123.548849::float8, '[SIMULATED #389] Colawin, near the path leading to the houses, earlier this afternoon. I saw dark smoke and flames from a small structure and moved away. I cannot confirm whether anyone was inside or what started the fire. Update: I can no longer see flames from a safe distance. We are waiting for an official all-clear.', 'Resolved', 63, 508),
