  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-029602960296'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00a000a000a0'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 2), 'Sakto nga wala sa ta mag-assume. Hulaton nato ang kumpirmadong detalye.', 72, 236),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-029702970297'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00a000a000a0'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 3), 'Unsang orasa nimo na-check ang aso ug siga? Basin lahi na ang kahimtang karon.', 72, 229),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-029802980298'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00a000a000a0'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 4), 'Nag-message ko sa akong pamilya nga mag-check una sa update sa dili pa moagi.', 72, 222),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-029902990299'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00a000a000a0'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 5), 'Clarification lang: ang akong gi-share kay akong nakita ra, dili opisyal nga findings. Mubo ra akong paglabay, wala ko nagpabilin didto. Basin naay laing detalye nga wala nako makita, mao nga dili nako makumpirma ang tibuok report.', 72, 215),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-029a029a029a'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00a000a000a0'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 6), 'Huwag i-forward ang screenshot na walang petsa. Baka lumang update iyon.', 72, 208),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-029b029b029b'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00a000a000a0'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 7), 'May bago na bang balita sa Colawin? Wala ako roon ngayon.', 72, 201),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-029c029c029c'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00a000a000a0'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 8), 'Salamat sa pagtul-id sa detalye. Mas klaro na karon kaysa sa unang nadungog nako.', 72, 194),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-029d029d029d'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00c500c500c5'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 9), 'Naa ba ni sa daplin sa pedestrian nga agianan?', 128, 307),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-029e029e029e'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00c500c500c5'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 10), 'Ayaw tukma o sulayi ang tabon. Likayi lang ug ipahibalo ang tukmang lugar sa maintenance.', 128, 300),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-029f029f029f'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00ea00ea00ea'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 11), 'Do you mean the pole beside the small shop?', 44, 343),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02a002a002a0'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00ea00ea00ea'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 12), 'Ayaw hikapa ang wiring. Ireport ang poste sa maintenance kon luwas makita ang numero.', 44, 336),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02a102a102a1'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-00ea00ea00ea'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 13), 'Nakaagi ko sa Mompeller, pero wala nako makita ang tibuok bahin sa palong nga suga. Dili nako ma-confirm ang tanan.', 44, 329),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02a202a202a2'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-010f010f010f'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 14), 'Is the argument continuing or have they left?', 111, 379),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02a302a302a3'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-010f010f010f'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 15), 'Keep some distance while tempers are raised. Contact the barangay if needed.', 111, 372),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02a402a402a4'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-010f010f010f'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 1), 'Nakaagi ko sa Linut-od, pero wala nako makita ang tibuok bahin sa kusog nga panaglalis. Dili nako ma-confirm ang tanan.', 111, 365),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02a502a502a5'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-010f010f010f'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 2), 'Update sa kusog nga panaglalis: nangutana na mi sa barangay. Wala pa mi nadawat nga kumpirmadong resulta.', 111, 358),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02a602a602a6'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-013401340134'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 3), 'May inaasahan bang delivery ang mga tindahan?', 27, 415),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02a702a702a7'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-013401340134'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 4), 'Parking alone is not evidence of a crime. Do not confront anyone or publish plate details here.', 27, 408),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02a802a802a8'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-013401340134'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 5), 'I passed through Talaytay, but did not see the whole situation with the parked van. I cannot confirm every detail.', 27, 401),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02a902a902a9'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-013401340134'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 6), 'Update sa nakaparada nga van: nangutana na mi sa barangay. Wala pa mi nadawat nga kumpirmadong resulta.', 27, 394),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02aa02aa02aa'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-013401340134'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 7), 'Nabalaka ko aning nakaparada nga van. Unta ma-check dayon, pero ayaw sa ta pagpakalat og wala makumpirma.', 27, 387),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02ab02ab02ab'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-015901590159'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 8), 'Sa kurbada po ba o sa tuwid na bahagi?', 94, 462),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02ac02ac02ac'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-017e017e017e'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 9), 'Unsang agianan imong naagian? Ayaw ipakita ang ID diri.', 10, 498),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02ad02ad02ad'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-017e017e017e'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 10), 'Kung may nakakita, huwag ipost ang mga ID. Ibigay sa barangay.', 10, 491),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02ae02ae02ae'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-01a301a301a3'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 11), 'Is there a safe alternative route rather than trying to cross?', 66, 534),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02af02af02af'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-01a301a301a3'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 12), 'Dili ta makasiguro sa giladmon pinaagi sa litrato. Ayaw pugsa og tabok.', 66, 527),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02b002b002b0'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-01a301a301a3'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 13), 'Dumaan ako sa Jampang pero hindi ko nakita ang buong pangyayari sa baha. Hindi ko makumpirma ang lahat.', 66, 520),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02b102b102b1'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-01c801c801c8'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 14), 'Naitanong na po sa tindahan kung may nagsauli?', 133, 570),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02b202b202b2'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-01c801c801c8'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 15), 'Ayaw lang sa ta pagngalan og tawo nga walay ebidensya. Itago ang resibo kon naa.', 133, 563),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02b302b302b3'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-01c801c801c8'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 1), 'Nakaagi ko sa Poblacion, pero wala nako makita ang tibuok bahin sa nawalang bag. Dili nako ma-confirm ang tanan.', 133, 556),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02b402b402b4'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-01c801c801c8'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 2), 'Update sa nawalang bag: nakapagtanong na kami sa barangay. Wala pang kumpirmadong resulta.', 133, 549),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02b502b502b5'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-01ed01ed01ed'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 3), 'Nabanggit ba kung anong delivery o sino ang hinahanap?', 49, 606),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02b602b602b6'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-01ed01ed01ed'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 4), 'Hindi krimen ang pagiging hindi kilala. Huwag mag-post ng mukha o personal na detalye.', 49, 599),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02b702b702b7'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-01ed01ed01ed'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 5), 'Nakaagi ko sa Langtad, pero wala nako makita ang tibuok bahin sa wala mailhing bisita. Dili nako ma-confirm ang tanan.', 49, 592),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02b802b802b8'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-01ed01ed01ed'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 6), 'Update: delivery diay nga nasayop og balay. Naklaro na, walay nahitabong krimen.', 49, 585),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02b902b902b9'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-01ed01ed01ed'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 7), 'Nag-aalala ako tungkol sa hindi kilalang bisita. Sana matingnan agad, pero huwag magkalat ng hindi kumpirmado.', 49, 578),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02ba02ba02ba'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-021202120212'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 8), 'Naa nay nitawag og tabang para sa rider?', 116, 642),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02bb02bb02bb'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-021202120212'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 9), 'Huwag ilipat ang nasugatan maliban kung may agarang panganib. Magbigay-daan sa responders.', 116, 635),
  ('c0ffee00-0000-4000-8000-02bc02bc02bc'::uuid, 'a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-021202120212'::uuid, pg_temp.sample_seed_user('commenter', 10), 'Nakaagi ko sa Canbanua, pero wala nako makita ang tibuok bahin sa bangga sa motor. Dili nako ma-confirm ang tanan.', 116, 628)
) as v(id, report_id, user_id, content, day_offset, minute_offset)
on conflict (id) do nothing;

